{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_ex01_end",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_ex01",
  "title": "Feint",
  "storyCode": "RI-EX-1",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_ex01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "2d3eb11546598507f5eceeea08bf1e9b30a7812deaacab981019e8d451ab6215",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "The scorching sun, the wilds, the golden sand, and the warm breeze! Woohoo! I feel a new song coming on!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "（solo）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "Could the both of you quiet down?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "Please. It's not often we get such a peaceful environment with no one chasing us. Can't we just have a nice, quiet rest?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "But Alty, I can smell the sea from here. Are you sure we're safe?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "Aya, could you not spoil the mood for once?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "Nowhere in the world is truly safe, but we have to learn to let ourselves relax sometimes.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "Maybe you're right.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "So what's the next step? How are we going to broaden our path? We can't go back empty-handed.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "At least that doctor gave us an answer this time.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Alty looks at the 'key' in her hand."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "Really? That looks like something special. And she just gave it to you? What did you trade for it?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "Knowledge.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "And was that a fair trade?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "I'm not sure. But I think that doctor wants us to put this knowledge to use.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "Wouldn't she know?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "We know a lot, she should just...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "...If you think about it, the real trade was her using our curiosity to get us to act.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "So, that means she didn't pay anything?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "Hm...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "Hm...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "We've been cheated.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "More like baited.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "Directed?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "Guided.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "Is that doctor really so important?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "No. I think she's trying to tell us that her actions have no impact at all.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "What matters is what we think and what we do.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "Then what about the key? Should we go?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "Ugh, this sucks. Could we not go?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "I'm thinking it's sort of like music... Our power should not be to force change onto others, we should just be singing our own songs.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "Sing for them. If it sounds good—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "Then they'll sing too.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "（solo）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "Hah, then we will give even more knowledge, and the key, over to the one who is ready.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "And who will that be?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "I don't know.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "Maybe they haven't been born yet.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "That would be great!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "No it wouldn't, Dan. We... hm?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "What is it, Alty?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "The car's dead.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "Didn't you prep it?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "Yes, but we took that detour.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "And I have to admit, it's really easy to lose your heading in the middle of the wilderness with no roads or signs.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "So basically, we're lost?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "I'm not sure that's how I'd put it. It's not so much that we're off course as it is we're carving a new path.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "We're lost.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "We're lost! That's a pretty good theme.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "You know, Dan, I really wish I could learn some of your optimism. So what are we going to do?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "It looks like there's a rainforest over that way. Let's check it out.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "So, who's getting out to push?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "We could take turns.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "Alty.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "What?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "We've got a crowd here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "Yes, we do.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "But I don't know what language they're speaking.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "So should we just let them follow us?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "Do you have a better idea?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "We could kill them all?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "You think you can get Frost and Dan to go along with that?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "(Strumming and singing)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
      "text": "&*......%$ ....& (W-What is this sound? And why do I like it so much?!)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria B",
      "text": "&%......% (I've never heard anything like it...)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "Hey, how is everybody?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "Can you tell me what language you're speaking?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "Oh, but I guess even if you told me, I still wouldn't know.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria C",
      "text": "......%&$ (Where did they come from?!)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria D",
      "text": "$......&# (And why does this one look so weird?)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "Well, at least there are people here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "I just hope there's a place we can resupply.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "Wishful thinking.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "You're outsiders?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "Huh? You speak Sargonian?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "Yes, it looks like you're definitely outsiders.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "What are you doing here?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "Our car died, so we're looking for someone with the Arts to recharge it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "...Come with me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "See, Aya, that was more than just wishful thinking.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "Fine. I guess the world is a magical place.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "Hey hey hey! What's this?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "There's a village here in the middle of this primeval forest!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "(Humming)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "It's really amazing. You can see the influence of modern architecture on most of the buildings, but they still have that primitive beauty.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "It's odd, but very special.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "I am the leader of this tribe, Zumama. Most of my people can understand your language.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "I can have some of our priests recharge your vehicle, but there are terms.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "What terms?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "I want to look inside your vehicle, at its structure.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "...Is that all?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "Yes.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "Are you sure you won't break it?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "I'm pretty sure.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "Alty?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "It's not like we have a choice.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "So...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "Agreed.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Eunectes",
      "text": "Good. High Priest...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "text": "I'm here! ...Oh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "text": "Hmmmmm....?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "text": "I know of you...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "I know of you...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "I never expected to see your kind here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "text": "Oh, honestly, I was thinking the exact same thing.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "text": "But I'm more interested in your vehicle than you!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "By all means.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "I said it before and I'll say it again. The world is a magical place.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "I have to say, I agree.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "At the same time, Frost hooks her guitar up to the ceremonial speaker and improvises a solo."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "Nice, Frost.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "This village is inspiring me.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "Awesome, Frost, you really switched up the melody this time.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "Heat, repressed...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "I'll call this song... 'D'!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
      "text": "Where's that sound coming from?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria B",
      "text": "What is it?I can feel it energizing me!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria C",
      "text": "It must be the outsiders who just came! Let's go see!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "There are more of them, Alty...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "That's not good.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "These lives thirst for music! For energy! For...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria B",
      "text": "What a voice!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria C",
      "text": "Outsider, give us more music!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "Alty... I know it's unexpected, but I think the atmosphere here is actually really good.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "Why don't we get out the amps and play together?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "I guess that would be fine.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "Yeah, can't let Frost take all the glory!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "I gotta get in on such a badass track!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "Then let the locals feel the music of AUS!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria A",
      "text": "It's just a few notes, but I'm too excited to sit still!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria B",
      "text": "It might be like what the priests do, it's called 'music'?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria C",
      "text": "I've never heard anything like it! Who are these people?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria D",
      "text": "I know, they must be 'Cuicayotl'!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "'Cuicayotl'? What's that?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "text": "Oh, that's how you say 'one who sings' in their language.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "text": "But it's been a long time since they had a 'Cuicayotl' here, and you've won them over with your music.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "text": "And I must say, your music is vastly different from that of any other 'Cuicayotl' I've ever heard before!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "High Priest",
      "text": "But no matter. I find yours a lot more fun!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria E",
      "text": "'Cuicayotl', give us another song!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Archosauria F",
      "text": "I'll give you anything! Just one more song!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "What do we do, Alty?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "Let's stay here, Alty!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "Well, I can't let you forget our goal...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "But, fine. We've got time.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "I never imagined there would be a Messenger here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "text": "And I never thought AUS, from all the magazine covers, would show up here either.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "Where's Zumama?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "text": "She's making the speaker system you asked for. So I'll be taking you.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "text": "How long are you going to stay?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "Maybe a week, maybe a month, maybe a whole year.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "This place is doing it for us. I think we can have some fun here, at least.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "text": "Then this is the right place for you to put on a show.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "So cool!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "It's... some kind of temple?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "text": "That's right. This is where all the tribes used to gather for the 'Mahuizzotia', but it hasn't been used since Gavial left.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "'Mahuizzotia'?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "Gavial? That name came up at Rhodes Island... No, it's probably just a common name.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "text": "You can perform here.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "We're going to give the people the best music they've ever heard.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "Yes, hahaha! Yes! We'll leave the mark of AUS right here!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Two months later..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "text": "AUS is unbelievable...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "text": "They actually did stay for two whole months.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "text": "If Gavial ever comes back, she's going to be blown away by the music we have way out here now.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "text": "The people fell in love with their rock and roll.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "text": "So what are they going to perform for us today?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "text": "...I wonder maybe if I'm their biggest fan.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "text": "AUS...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "text": "Huh?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The room is empty. All the toiletries and bedding are neat and tidy, with a piece of paper resting on the table in the center."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "text": "They're gone?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "text": "There's a note on the table. Let's see...",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "text": "'We left. Don't miss us. I hope you enjoyed the music. Also, we left all our records here for you. Have fun. -AUS'",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Inam",
      "text": "...Heh, they really are unbelievable.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "I don't think I'll ever forget that Acahualla place.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "(Humming) It was definitely unforgettable.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "But the people there are really noisy, and wild.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "Yeah? I love them!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "Of course you do. I don't think you'd mind if we left you there.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "I was definitely thinking about it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "Don't you think those people have a kind of natural, primal energy?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "Out of all the countries and cities we've been to, I've never seen people like that.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "I love 'em!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "Well, you're right about that much.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Frost",
      "text": "They really get our music. They're the best audience we've ever had.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "I think Frost likes them too.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "But we can't just show up and flip a whole civilization upside-down. We should stick to singing.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "Sing for them. If it sounds good—",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Dan",
      "text": "Then they'll sing too.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Aya",
      "text": "Didn't we say that before?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "Who knows? We might've said it a million times already.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "Let's go. Continue on our journey.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Alty",
      "text": "If we sing to the world, will she listen?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A few of the bandmates joke around for a bit, until the car goes silent.\nAlty looks at the key in her hand, 'Dr. Kal'tsit, can that Rhodes Island of yours give the world the answer it's looking for?'"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
